          },
          "id": "1775863428484",
          "code": "RETENTION_RISK_WIDGET",
          "type": "LLM",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775863428484_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using: {{$context.$variables.insightsArray}}\n\nGenerate a structured insight output by combining signals from the why section and facts/summary from the what section.\n\nInput Guidelines:\n\n- Each object contains what and why sections\n- why.reasons contains signals (root causes)\n- what.summary and what.facts contain outcomes (impact/state)\n- Treat all data as belonging to one context\n- Do not output JSON\n\n---\n\nOutput Requirements:\n\n1. Short Explanation\n\n- Write one sentence expanding the headline\n- Combine signals (why) + outcomes (what)\n- Clearly connect cause to impact\n- Prefix the sentence with ⚠️ symbol and display the text in Orange color\n\n2. Header (Level 4 Markdown)\n\n- Generate a one-line headline describing the primary risk or situation\n- The headline must be derived from key signals in why.reasons\n- Focus on cause (not generic wording)\n- Format as: #### <Headline>\n\n3. Detailed Insight Section\n\n- Write 2 to 3 sentences describing the situation in more detail\n- Use:\n\n  - Signals from why.reasons (cause)\n  - Facts and summary from what (impact)\n- Follow with bullet points highlighting key details\n\nBullet Rules:\n\n- Use concise bullets\n- Include a mix of:\n\n  - Signals (from why.reasons)\n  - Metrics or facts (from what.facts if present)\n- Avoid duplication\n\n---\n\nStyle Constraints:\n\n- Professional and concise\n- No repetition\n- Do not mention field names like what, why, facts, reasons\n- No ALL CAPS\n- Focus on cause → impact storytelling\n\n---\n\nOutput Format:\n\n\n<1 sentence explanation with warning symbol and warning color>\n#### <Headline>\n\n<2–3 sentence detailed paragraph>\n\n- <bullet point 1>\n- <bullet point 2>\n- <bullet point 3>"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": ""
        },
        {
