              "value": "If there are rows in {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_RECOMMENDATIONS.$output.result}}, generate a high priority actionable oraInsight for each record in the array {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_RECOMMENDATIONS.$output.result}}. For each record, create an actionable insight object with the following fields:\n- title: use Title property from each row\n- shortDescription: use Task property from each row\n- actionText: \"Review\"\n- priority: true\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(launchOpportunity,{\\\"opportunityId\\\":\"\"+<opportunityId in each row>,\\\"task\\\":<Task in each row>,\\\"title\\\":<Title in each row>,\\\"action\\\":\\\"invokeSuggestedTask\\\"})\""
            }
